\pard\plain \s4\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs20\cgrid 
Detailed Description\par
\pard\plain 
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Provides GLSL functions to pack and unpack half, single and double-precision floating point values into more compact integer types.\par
These functions do not operate component-wise, rather as described in each case.\par
Include <{\b glm/packing.hpp}> to use these core features.\par
}{\pard\widctlpar\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brsp20 \adjustright \par}
